        {
          "_key": "000000000006",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Nestled between the rugged mountains of the"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000003"
              ],
              "text": " Sinai Peninsula"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " and the serene waters of the Gulf of Aqaba, Nuweiba is a hidden gem in Egypt, offering a tranquil escape from the bustle of more crowded tourist destinations. For those looking to explore this serene coastal town, navigating Nuweiba is both a journey and an adventure in itself."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sinai_Peninsula",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "By Taxi: The Local Way to Traverse"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Taxis in Nuweiba are plentiful and provide a convenient way to get around. They’re perfect for short trips within the town or for venturing to nearby attractions. Always agree on the fare before starting your journey, as meters are not commonly used here. Taxis offer a personal and direct way to explore, with "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000a"
              ],
              "text": "local"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " drivers often willing to share insights into the best spots to visit."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
