          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Renting a Car: For the Independent Explorer"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "For those who prefer to explore at their own pace, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000011"
              ],
              "text": "renting a car"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " is an excellent option. Nuweiba’s roads are generally straightforward and less crowded, making for a pleasant driving "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000014"
              ],
              "text": "experience"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". Car rental can be arranged in the town or pre-booked from larger cities like "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000017"
              ],
              "text": "Sharm El-Sheikh"
            },
            {
              "_key": "ecxtzuglzmd0",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " or "
            },
            {
              "_key": "8kjtcn9a1lit",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "b1mxxagtppfg"
              ],
              "text": "Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "y85regqiais7",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". Having your own vehicle allows for spontaneous detours to hidden beaches or desert "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001a"
              ],
              "text": "excursions"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", providing a sense of freedom and adventure."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
