          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000026",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Biking: A Scenic and Healthy Alternative"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000028",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "For the more active traveler, bicycles are a great way to explore Nuweiba. The town’s relatively flat terrain and scenic landscapes make it ideal for cycling. Biking allows you to take in the views at your own pace, stop for impromptu swims, and access areas that are off the beaten path."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000029",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Walking: Immerse in the Town’s Charm"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000002b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Finally, Nuweiba is a town that lends itself beautifully to exploration on foot, especially the market area and the beachfront. Walking through the town, you’ll discover small cafes, local markets, and friendly faces, offering an intimate experience of Nuweiba’s laid-back "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002c"
              ],
              "text": "lifestyle"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            }
          ],
